                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \square
          %h2#YonedaCorollaries Corollaries
          %p The Yoneda lemma has the following direct consequences. As the Yoneda lemma itself, these are as easily established as they are useful and important.
          %h3#corollary_i_yoneda_embedding corollary I: Yoneda embedding
          %p
            The Yoneda lemma implies that the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yoneda+embedding"} Yoneda embedding
            functor
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
