                  [C^{op},Set](C(-,c),C(-,d)) \simeq (C(-,d))(c) = C(c,d)
          %h3#corollary_ii_uniqueness_of_representing_objects corollary II: uniqueness of representing objects
          %p
            Since the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yoneda+embedding"} Yoneda embedding
            is a
            = succeed "," do
